\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Why these parameters were used\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf0 model=yolov8s.pt
\f0\fs28 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Uses 
\f0\b YOLOv8 small
\f1\b0  pretrained weights.\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Good tradeoff between speed and accuracy, and ideal when the dataset is relatively small because transfer learning helps convergence.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf0 data=.../data.yaml
\f0\fs28 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Points YOLO to the dataset paths and class definitions (2 classes).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf0 imgsz=1024
\f0\fs28 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Uses 
\f0\b high input resolution
\f1\b0  to improve detection of smaller or more detailed objects.\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Especially useful when objects (stairs/elevator) may occupy limited pixels in wide scenes.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf0 epochs=300
\f0\fs28 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Sets an upper bound of training time.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Allows enough training opportunity for convergence, while actual stopping is controlled by early stopping (
\f2\fs26 patience
\f1\fs24 ).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf0 batch=16
\f0\fs28 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Balances 
\f0\b GPU memory usage
\f1\b0  and stable gradients.\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Fits comfortably on an A40 while using 1024 images, and gives reasonable throughput.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf0 lr0=0.001
\f0\fs28 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Intended to use a conservative initial learning rate suitable for fine-tuning.\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Note: the log shows 
\f2\fs26 optimizer=auto
\f1\fs24  was used, so Ultralytics selected the final LR automatically (it chose MuSGD and set lr accordingly).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf0 cos_lr=True
\f0\fs28 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls12\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Enables 
\f0\b cosine learning rate scheduling
\f1\b0 , which typically improves fine-tuning stability:\
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls12\ilvl1\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 larger steps early\
\ls12\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 smaller steps later for refinement\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls12\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Often helpful on small datasets to avoid oscillation late in training.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf0 patience=30
\f0\fs28 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls13\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Enables 
\f0\b early stopping
\f1\b0  if validation metrics stop improving for 30 epochs.\
\ls13\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prevents wasting compute and reduces overfitting risk.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs30\fsmilli15210 \cf0 device=0
\f0\fs28 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls14\ilvl0
